<div class="validation-flow">
  <div class="visual-caption"><span>평가 데이터를 다시 나눴습니다</span><small>시간순 분할 개념도</small></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 400 120" role="img" aria-labelledby="split-title split-desc">
    <title id="split-title">과거로 학습하고 이후 데이터로 평가</title>
    <desc id="split-desc">왼쪽의 과거 데이터는 학습에, 오른쪽의 이후 데이터는 평가에 사용합니다. 구간 길이는 설명을 위해 임의로 그렸습니다.</desc>
    <path d="M20 24H376m-8-5 8 5-8 5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    <text x="20" y="14">과거</text><text x="376" y="14" text-anchor="end">미래</text>
    <rect x="20" y="42" width="212" height="52" rx="6" fill="#2453c6"/>
    <rect x="244" y="42" width="132" height="52" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#2453c6" stroke-width="1.5"/>
    <text x="126" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="train-label">학습 데이터</text>
    <text x="310" y="74" text-anchor="middle" class="test-label">평가 데이터</text>
    <path d="M238 34V106" stroke="#68718a" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="evaluation-results">
    <div><span>초기 평가</span><strong>0.98<small>R²</small></strong><p>데이터 누수 의심</p></div>
    <div><span>시간순 평가</span><strong>0.81<small>R²</small></strong><p>분할 조건 수정 후</p></div>
  </div>
  <p class="visual-footnote">두 점수는 분할 조건이 달라 직접 비교하기 어렵습니다.</p>
</div>
<style>
  .validation-flow{background:var(--accent-soft);padding:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:20px;min-width:0}
  svg{width:100%;height:auto;color:#5a6075;display:block}
  text{font:13px var(--sans);fill:currentColor}
  .train-label,.test-label{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}
  .train-label{fill:#fff}.test-label{fill:#204bb5}
  .evaluation-results{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
  .evaluation-results>div{border-top:1px solid #c6d5f0;padding-top:14px}
  .evaluation-results span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
  .evaluation-results strong{font-size:42px;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.3;display:block;color:#204bb5;font-weight:650;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
  .evaluation-results>div:first-child strong{color:#566079;font-size:32px;font-weight:500}
  .evaluation-results strong small{font-size:13px;margin-left:6px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0}
  .evaluation-results p{font-size:12px;color:var(--ink)}
  @media screen and (max-width:680px){text{font-size:16px}.train-label,.test-label{font-size:18px}.validation-flow{padding:24px 20px;gap:18px}.evaluation-results strong{font-size:36px}.evaluation-results>div:first-child strong{font-size:28px}}
  @media print{.validation-flow{padding:3mm;gap:2mm}svg{max-height:20mm}.evaluation-results{gap:4mm}.evaluation-results>div{padding-top:2mm}.evaluation-results span,.evaluation-results p{font-size:7pt}.evaluation-results strong{font-size:27pt}.evaluation-results strong small{font-size:8pt}.evaluation-results>div:first-child strong{font-size:21pt}}
</style>
